{"cls":"level","html":"\n<div class=\"pagehead\" id=\"phU\"><h1 class=\"pg-t\"><span class=\"pg-n\">2</span>Using agents</h1><p class=\"pg-s\">One agent, eight ways to use it; they differ in four things.</p><details class=\"pg-more\"><summary aria-label=\"Expand notes for this stop\" title=\"Notes for this stop\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">ⓘ</span> Notes</summary><div class=\"ph-one\">Agents seen from “how you use them”: who starts it, where it runs, what it can touch, and whether you watch. Each way links down to how it works.</div><p class=\"ph-why\"><b>Why it’s designed this way: </b>Knowing how it can be used first gives the principles something to hang on.</p></details><div class=\"ph-top\"><span class=\"ph-lv\">Stop 2 of 24 </span><span>📍 App overview › Using agents</span></div><div class=\"ph-map\" id=\"pmU\"><span>On this page: </span><button class=\"\" data-sj=\"c_U_0\" data-sp=\"U\">One agent: why so…</button><button class=\"\" data-sj=\"c_U_1\" data-sp=\"U\">Eight ways to use it…</button><button class=\"\" data-sj=\"c_U_2\" data-sp=\"U\">How to choose: four…</button><button class=\"l3\" data-sj=\"labPick\" data-sp=\"U\">🧪 Pick a way: tick…</button><button class=\"\" data-sj=\"c_U_3\" data-sp=\"U\">🧠 The logic…</button><button class=\"\" data-sj=\"c_U_m3\" data-sp=\"U\">🗂️ Where to find real…</button></div><div class=\"zoomnote\" id=\"znU\" style=\"display:none\"></div></div><!--m2top--><div class=\"pl-top\" data-pl=\"U\"><!--m2p--><div class=\"plain\"><p class=\"pl-tag\">🧒 In plain words first</p><p>An Agent is like a <b>helper that can actually do things</b>. There are many ways to use it, but inside it is always the same thing. The ways differ in only four things: <b>who tells it to start</b>, <b>where it works</b>, <b>what it can touch</b>, and <b>whether you watch</b>.</p></div><!--/m2p--></div><!--/m2top-->\n<div class=\"m-stage\"><div class=\"m-dg main\"><div class=\"m-vbar\"><span class=\"m-vh\">👆 Tap a box for details<br>🤏 Pinch or double-tap</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"vz\" data-vz=\"out\" aria-label=\"Zoom out\">−</button><span class=\"vp\" aria-live=\"polite\">100%</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"vz\" data-vz=\"in\" aria-label=\"Zoom in\">＋</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"vz\" data-vz=\"reset\" aria-label=\"Reset\" disabled=\"\">⟲</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"vz\" data-vz=\"full\" aria-label=\"View full screen\">⛶</button></div><div class=\"diagram m-vw\"><svg id=\"svgU\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 572\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-m=\"1\"><defs><marker id=\"ahsvgU\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" fill=\"#94a3b8\"></path></marker></defs><rect class=\"u-zone\" x=\"3\" y=\"152\" width=\"182\" height=\"236\" rx=\"14\"></rect><rect class=\"u-zone\" x=\"195\" y=\"152\" width=\"182\" height=\"236\" rx=\"14\"></rect><g class=\"comp cat-use\" data-id=\"uHub\" data-train=\"no\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Using agents (overview)\"><rect class=\"main\" x=\"95\" y=\"6\" width=\"190\" height=\"56\" rx=\"12\"></rect><text class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:15px\" x=\"190\" y=\"31.0\">Using agents</text><text class=\"s\" x=\"190\" y=\"49.0\">One agent, many ways</text></g><path class=\"arrow\" d=\"M170 62 V74 H94 V84\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#ahsvgU)\"></path><path class=\"arrow\" d=\"M210 62 V74 H286 V84\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#ahsvgU)\"></path><g class=\"comp cat-use\" data-id=\"uWith\" data-train=\"no\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Work alongside it\"><rect class=\"main\" x=\"3\" y=\"88\" width=\"182\" height=\"58\" rx=\"12\"></rect><text class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:15px\" x=\"94\" y=\"114.0\">Work alongside it</text><text class=\"s\" x=\"94\" y=\"132.0\">You watch each step</text><text x=\"171\" y=\"138\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"zm-h\">🔍</text></g><g class=\"comp cat-use\" data-id=\"uSolo\" data-train=\"no\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Let it run alone\"><rect class=\"main\" x=\"195\" y=\"88\" width=\"182\" height=\"58\" rx=\"12\"></rect><text class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:15px\" x=\"286\" y=\"114.0\">Let it run alone</text><text class=\"s\" x=\"286\" y=\"132.0\">Hand off, check later</text><text x=\"363\" y=\"138\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"zm-h\">🔍</text></g><g class=\"comp cat-use\" data-id=\"uChat\" data-train=\"no\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Chat assistant\"><rect class=\"main\" x=\"11\" y=\"160\" width=\"166\" height=\"50\" rx=\"12\"></rect><text class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:14.5px\" x=\"94\" y=\"182.0\">Chat assistant</text><text class=\"s\" x=\"94\" y=\"200.0\">Ask &amp; answer; safest</text></g><g class=\"comp cat-use\" data-id=\"uIde\" data-train=\"no\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Coding agent in the editor\"><rect class=\"main\" x=\"11\" y=\"218\" width=\"166\" height=\"50\" rx=\"12\"></rect><text class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:14.5px\" x=\"94\" y=\"240.0\">Editor agent</text><text class=\"s\" x=\"94\" y=\"258.0\">Review each diff</text></g><g class=\"comp cat-use\" data-id=\"uCli\" data-train=\"no\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Command-line coding agent\"><rect class=\"main\" x=\"11\" y=\"276\" width=\"166\" height=\"50\" rx=\"12\"></rect><text class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:14.5px\" x=\"94\" y=\"298.0\">Command-line agent</text><text class=\"s\" x=\"94\" y=\"316.0\">Access by level</text></g><g class=\"comp cat-use\" data-id=\"uCua\" data-train=\"no\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Browser / computer-use agent\"><rect class=\"main\" x=\"11\" y=\"334\" width=\"166\" height=\"50\" rx=\"12\"></rect><text class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:14.5px\" x=\"94\" y=\"356.0\">Computer-use agent</text><text class=\"s\" x=\"94\" y=\"374.0\">Sees screen, clicks</text></g><g class=\"comp cat-use\" data-id=\"uBg\" data-train=\"no\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Background / cloud agent\"><rect class=\"main\" x=\"203\" y=\"160\" width=\"166\" height=\"50\" rx=\"12\"></rect><text class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:14.5px\" x=\"286\" y=\"182.0\">Background agent</text><text class=\"s\" x=\"286\" y=\"200.0\">Sandbox; returns a PR</text></g><g class=\"comp cat-use\" data-id=\"uRoutine\" data-train=\"no\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Routines &amp; automation\"><rect class=\"main\" x=\"203\" y=\"218\" width=\"166\" height=\"50\" rx=\"12\"></rect><text class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:14.5px\" x=\"286\" y=\"240.0\">Routines</text><text class=\"s\" x=\"286\" y=\"258.0\">On a schedule or event</text></g><g class=\"comp cat-use\" data-id=\"uMulti\" data-train=\"no\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Multi-agent teams\"><rect class=\"main\" x=\"203\" y=\"276\" width=\"166\" height=\"50\" rx=\"12\"></rect><text class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:14.5px\" x=\"286\" y=\"298.0\">Multi-agent team</text><text class=\"s\" x=\"286\" y=\"316.0\">Split, run, merge</text></g><text class=\"u-note\" x=\"286\" y=\"352\" text-anchor=\"middle\">The two below</text><text class=\"u-note\" x=\"286\" y=\"370\" text-anchor=\"middle\">serve both sides ↓</text><g class=\"comp cat-use\" data-id=\"uKit\" data-train=\"no\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Extend it\"><rect class=\"main\" x=\"3\" y=\"404\" width=\"182\" height=\"58\" rx=\"12\"></rect><text class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:15px\" x=\"94\" y=\"430.0\">Extend it</text><text class=\"s\" x=\"94\" y=\"448.0\">Tools · MCP · skills</text><text x=\"171\" y=\"454\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"zm-h\">🔍</text></g><g class=\"comp cat-use\" data-id=\"uWell\" data-train=\"no\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Use it well\"><rect class=\"main\" x=\"195\" y=\"404\" width=\"182\" height=\"58\" rx=\"12\"></rect><text class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:15px\" x=\"286\" y=\"430.0\">Use it well</text><text class=\"s\" x=\"286\" y=\"448.0\">Clear brief · context</text><text x=\"363\" y=\"454\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"zm-h\">🔍</text></g><path class=\"arrow\" d=\"M94 462 V478 H178 V496\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#ahsvgU)\"></path><path class=\"arrow\" d=\"M286 462 V478 H202 V496\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#ahsvgU)\"></path><g class=\"comp cat-agent\" data-id=\"app\" data-train=\"no\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Agent app layer\"><rect class=\"main\" x=\"65\" y=\"500\" width=\"250\" height=\"62\" rx=\"12\"></rect><text class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:15px\" x=\"190\" y=\"528.0\">How it works: agent app</text><text class=\"s\" x=\"190\" y=\"546.0\">LLM + tools + loop</text><text x=\"301\" y=\"554\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"zm-h\">🔍</text></g></svg></div></div><details class=\"m-leg\"><summary>🎨 Legend: what the colours mean</summary><div class=\"legend\"><span><i style=\"--c:#15803d;--f:#dcfce7\"></i>Usage (how to use)</span><span><i style=\"--c:#a21caf;--f:#fae8ff\"></i>Agent internals</span></div></details></div>\n<div class=\"card has-meta\" id=\"c_U_0\" data-z=\"1\" data-zl=\"② Diagram\" data-nh=\"1\" data-cc=\"1\">\n<div class=\"cc-meta\"><span class=\"zl z2\">② Diagram</span></div><h2><button type=\"button\" class=\"cc-h\" aria-expanded=\"true\">One agent: why so many ways to use it?</button></h2><div class=\"cc-body\"><!--m2p--><details class=\"deep\"><summary><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ic\"><path d=\"M6 9.5l6 6 6-6\"/></svg><span>Go deeper (the full explanation)</span></summary><!--/m2p-->\n\n<p class=\"lead\">Underneath, every way of using it is the same thing: an <a data-open=\"app\">agent</a> = LLM + tools + a <a data-open=\"loop\">loop</a>. The difference is only four things in the outer layer:</p>\n<ul class=\"pts\">\n<li><b>Who starts it</b>: you, or a timer / an event / another agent.</li>\n<li><b>Where it runs</b>: a web page, your computer, or an isolated cloud environment.</li>\n<li><b>What it can touch</b>: only talk, or also edit files, run commands, click pages, send messages.</li>\n<li><b>Your role</b>: watch every step (alongside), or only check the result (alone).</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Tap a box in the diagram to see each one; boxes with 🔍 lead down to a sub-stop. The <a data-open=\"app\">Agent app layer</a> box at the bottom links to the “how it works” side: the <a data-go=\"T2\">Agent</a> stop shows how it runs inside.</p>\n<!--m2pe--></details><!--/m2pe--></div></div>\n<div class=\"card has-meta\" id=\"c_U_1\" data-z=\"2\" data-zl=\"③ Details · why\" data-nh=\"1\" data-cc=\"1\">\n<div class=\"cc-meta\"><span class=\"zl zm\">③ Details · why</span></div><h3><button type=\"button\" class=\"cc-h\" aria-expanded=\"true\">Eight ways to use it, in one table</button></h3><div class=\"cc-body\"><!--m2p--><div class=\"plain\"><p class=\"pl-tag\">🧒 In plain words first</p><p>The eight ways are lined up in a table by those four things, so you can compare them at a glance like a <b>timetable</b>: which only talk, which can change files, which you must watch, and which you can just hand over.</p></div><details class=\"deep\"><summary><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ic\"><path d=\"M6 9.5l6 6 6-6\"/></svg><span>Go deeper (the full explanation)</span></summary><!--/m2p-->\n\n<p>The common ways, laid out by the four things above (tap a name for details):</p>\n<table class=\"gl stack u-tab\"><tbody><tr><th>Way to use it</th><th>Who starts it</th><th>Where it runs</th><th>What it can touch</th><th>Your role</th></tr><tr><td><a data-open=\"uChat\">Chat assistant</a></td><td data-label=\"Who starts it\">You</td><td data-label=\"Where it runs\">Web / app</td><td data-label=\"What it can touch\">Talk; a few built-in tools</td><td data-label=\"Your role\">Read every reply</td></tr><tr><td><a data-open=\"uIde\">Coding agent in the editor</a></td><td data-label=\"Who starts it\">You</td><td data-label=\"Where it runs\">Your computer (editor)</td><td data-label=\"What it can touch\">Read/write project files, run commands</td><td data-label=\"Your role\">Review diffs, then accept</td></tr><tr><td><a data-open=\"uCli\">Command-line coding agent</a></td><td data-label=\"Who starts it\">You (or a script)</td><td data-label=\"Where it runs\">Terminal: local or remote</td><td data-label=\"What it can touch\">Files, commands, git</td><td data-label=\"Your role\">Set the permission level, confirm key steps</td></tr><tr><td><a data-open=\"uCua\">Browser / computer-use agent</a></td><td data-label=\"Who starts it\">You</td><td data-label=\"Where it runs\">An isolated browser / VM</td><td data-label=\"What it can touch\">Click, type, scroll</td><td data-label=\"Your role\">Watch; confirm before paying or sending</td></tr><tr><td><a data-open=\"uBg\">Background / cloud agent</a></td><td data-label=\"Who starts it\">You hand off a task</td><td data-label=\"Where it runs\">A cloud sandbox</td><td data-label=\"What it can touch\">A copy of the code</td><td data-label=\"Your role\">Review the PR, then merge</td></tr><tr><td><a data-open=\"uRoutine\">Routines & automation</a></td><td data-label=\"Who starts it\">A timer / an event</td><td data-label=\"Where it runs\">Cloud or a server</td><td data-label=\"What it can touch\">Tools fixed in advance</td><td data-label=\"Your role\">Read reports and exceptions</td></tr><tr><td><a data-open=\"uMulti\">Multi-agent teams</a></td><td data-label=\"Who starts it\">A coordinator agent</td><td data-label=\"Where it runs\">Several separate contexts</td><td data-label=\"What it can touch\">Each its own part</td><td data-label=\"Your role\">Check the merged result</td></tr><tr><td><a data-open=\"uKit\">Extensions: tools · MCP · skills</a></td><td data-label=\"Who starts it\">(added to any of the above)</td><td data-label=\"Where it runs\">Same as above</td><td data-label=\"What it can touch\">New actions and know-how</td><td data-label=\"Your role\">Install only trusted ones</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!--m2pe--></details><!--/m2pe--></div></div>\n<div class=\"card has-meta\" id=\"c_U_2\" data-z=\"2\" data-zl=\"③ Details · why\" data-nh=\"1\" data-cc=\"1\">\n<div class=\"cc-meta\"><span class=\"zl zm\">③ Details · why</span></div><h3><button type=\"button\" class=\"cc-h\" aria-expanded=\"true\">How to choose: four questions about the task</button></h3><div class=\"cc-body\"><!--m2p--><div class=\"plain\"><p class=\"pl-tag\">🧒 In plain words first</p><p>Before choosing, ask four questions: <b>does it need to do things? Can you check whether it did them right? Is it something you do often? Can a mistake be undone?</b> For things that cannot be undone (sending, deleting, paying), always keep a step where a person says yes.</p></div><details class=\"deep\"><summary><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ic\"><path d=\"M6 9.5l6 6 6-6\"/></svg><span>Go deeper (the full explanation)</span></summary><!--/m2p-->\n\n<ol class=\"pts\">\n<li><b>Does it need to act?</b> Just asking or writing → a chat assistant is enough.</li>\n<li><b>Is the goal clear and checkable?</b> Clear with tests → hand it to a background agent; still taking shape → work alongside it.</li>\n<li><b>Does it repeat?</b> Every day / whenever new data arrives → make it a routine.</li>\n<li><b>Can a mistake be undone?</b> Sending, deleting, paying are irreversible → always keep a human confirmation step.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>The lab below turns these questions into checkboxes so you can see where different tasks land.</p>\n<!--m2pe--></details><!--/m2pe--></div></div>\n<div class=\"lab-divider\" data-z=\"3\"><span>🧪 Hands-on lab: Using agents</span></div>\n<div class=\"card lab has-meta\" id=\"labPick\" data-z=\"3\" data-zl=\"🧪 Lab\" data-nh=\"1\">\n<div class=\"cc-meta\"><span class=\"zl z3\">🧪 Lab</span><span class=\"tag demo tag-s\" title=\"Illustrative\">Illustrative</span></div><h3>🧪 Pick a way: tick the task’s traits, see the advice</h3><!--m2p--><div class=\"plain pl-lab\"><p class=\"pl-tag\">🧒 In plain words first</p><p>Tick what your task is like and see which way of using an Agent is suggested; tick “risky” and see how the answer changes (the rules are a simplified illustration).</p></div><!--/m2p--><p class=\"tag-note\">ⓘ The rules are a simplified teaching version (Illustrative); real choices also depend on the tools you have.</p>\n<div class=\"lab-why bz\"><div class=\"bz-h\"><b>Why it’s built this way:</b></div><ul class=\"pts\"><li>Look at the task before picking the tool: the same agent used the wrong way is either too slow or too risky.</li><li>The “risky” trait changes the answer: irreversible actions always keep a human confirmation step.</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ctrls\" id=\"pkPre\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Example tasks\"></div>\n<div class=\"u-checks\" id=\"pkFeat\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Task traits\"></div>\n<div class=\"u-out\" id=\"pkOut\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>\n<div class=\"lab-obs bz\"><div class=\"bz-h\"><b>👀 Try this:</b></div><ul class=\"pts\"><li>Tap the “weekly report” example, then tick “risky” and watch the advice change</li><li>Tick only “edits code” and “clear, checkable, not urgent”; see what it recommends</li></ul></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"card has-meta\" id=\"c_U_3\" data-z=\"2\" data-zl=\"③ Details · why\" data-nh=\"1\" data-cc=\"1\">\n<div class=\"cc-meta\"><span class=\"zl zm\">③ Details · why</span></div><h3><button type=\"button\" class=\"cc-h\" aria-expanded=\"true\">🧠 The logic underneath: access × oversight</button></h3><div class=\"cc-body\"><!--m2p--><div class=\"plain\"><p class=\"pl-tag\">🧒 In plain words first</p><p>The <b>more keys</b> you give the helper (the more it can do), the more it needs <b>someone watching</b> or to be kept in a safe little room. Also, small mistakes add up: every step has a small chance of going wrong, and over many steps the chance of getting them all right shrinks a lot, so long tasks need checks along the way.</p></div><details class=\"deep\"><summary><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ic\"><path d=\"M6 9.5l6 6 6-6\"/></svg><span>Go deeper (the full explanation)</span></summary><!--/m2p-->\n\n<p>Every way of using it sits on one chart: across is <b>how much access it gets</b>, up is <b>how closely you watch</b>. The more access, the more oversight or isolation it needs.</p>\n<ul class=\"pts\">\n<li><b>Reversible vs irreversible</b>: file edits can be undone (git, checkpoints); a sent email, deleted data or a payment cannot. Leave the irreversible step to a person; see <a data-open=\"perm\">Least privilege and human confirmation</a>.</li>\n<li><b>Least privilege</b>: grant only what the task needs, and take it back afterwards.</li>\n<li><b>Small errors add up</b>: if each step is 95% reliable, all 20 steps go right only 0.95²⁰ ≈ 36% of the time <span class=\"tag demo tag-s\" title=\"Illustrative\">Illustrative</span>. Long tasks need checks along the way (tests, confirmations); see <a data-open=\"guard\">Guardrails</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<!--m2pe--></details><!--/m2pe--></div></div>\n<div class=\"card quiz has-meta\" id=\"quizU\" data-sec=\"U\" data-z=\"3\" data-zl=\"❓ Quiz\" data-nh=\"1\"></div>\n<div class=\"card has-meta\" id=\"c_U_m3\" data-z=\"2\" data-zl=\"③ Details · why\" data-nh=\"1\" data-cc=\"1\">\n<div class=\"cc-meta\"><span class=\"zl zm\">③ Details · why</span></div><h3><button type=\"button\" class=\"cc-h\" aria-expanded=\"true\">🗂️ Where to find real products</button></h3><div class=\"cc-body\"><!--m2p--><div class=\"plain\"><p class=\"pl-tag\">🧒 In plain words first</p><p>To see which real products fit each way of using an Agent, and where their websites are, go to the “Products” stop.</p></div><!--/m2p-->\n\n<p>Which real products offer each way, and their official sites, are on the <a data-go=\"Up\">Products</a> stop: grouped by way, with official links, filterable by mainland-run or open source.</p>\n</div></div>\n<!--m2h--><nav class=\"m-hand\" aria-label=\"Where next\"><p class=\"mh-t\">🧭 Where next</p><button type=\"button\" class=\"mh-b dn\" data-go=\"Ua\"><span class=\"mh-k\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ic\"><path d=\"M12 5v13M6.5 12.5L12 18l5.5-5.5\"/></svg>Go deeper</span><b>Work alongside it</b><span class=\"mh-r\">Mode one: you work alongside it</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mh-b dn\" data-go=\"Up\"><span class=\"mh-k\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ic\"><path d=\"M12 5v13M6.5 12.5L12 18l5.5-5.5\"/></svg>Go deeper</span><b>Products</b><span class=\"mh-r\">Find real products by mode</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mh-b up\" data-go=\"T1\"><span class=\"mh-k\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ic\"><path d=\"M12 19V6M6.5 11.5L12 6l5.5 5.5\"/></svg>One level up</span><b>App overview</b><span class=\"mh-r\">Back to the big picture</span></button><p class=\"mh-c\"><span>🧪 Labs on this page:</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"mh-x\" data-sj=\"labPick\" data-sp=\"U\">Pick a way: tick…</button></p><p class=\"mh-c\"><span>Concepts used here, explained elsewhere:</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"mh-x\" data-open=\"sample\">Sampling</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mh-x\" data-open=\"kProb\">Distributions &amp; expectation</button></p></nav><!--/m2h-->\n<div class=\"ph-nav m-pn\" data-sec=\"U\"></div>\n"}
